1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,950
(Leonard:)And then,
instead of living alone

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:04,280
(Raj:)in my tiny apartment,
I'd have a big mansion.

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,750
(Bernadette:)That sounds great.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,220
(Raj:)It is.

5
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,420
(Raj:)If you like wandering
around a big, empty house

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:12,060
(Raj:)with no one to love you.

7
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:15,890
(Howard:)We'd come visit you.
No, you wouldn't.

8
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:19,100
(Raj:)You'd be intimidated
by my wealth and fame.

9
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,100
(Raj:)My only friends would be

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,530
(Raj:)my genetically engineered
monkey butler

11
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:25,900
(Raj:)and the little people I hired
to be my living chess set.

12
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,710
(Bernadette:)He's taking a turn to
the dark side, isn't he?

13
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,880
(Leonard:)Hold on.
He could come back.

14
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,250
(Raj:)Oh, what's the point
of everything?

15
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,680
(Howard:)Nope. He's gone.

16
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,230
(Raj:)You know it's been more
than a year

17
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:39,480
(Raj:)since I've even kissed a girl?

18
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:42,570
(Howard:)What about that hookup
at Comic-Con you told me about?

19
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:43,850
(Raj:)Oh, grow up. I was lying.

20
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:46,320
(Raj:)I lie all the time.
Nobody wants to kiss me.

21
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,590
(Bernadette:)Oh, you poor, poor thing.

22
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:51,500
(Bernadette:)Raj, you have to know
you're a wonderful man.

23
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,160
(Bernadette:)There are a lot of girls out
there who'll want to kiss you.

24
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:56,100
(Raj:)Where?

25
00:00:56,100 --> 00:01:00,020
(Bernadette:)You just have to look.

